The redraw eventually solved the easy rung, so the harness correctly escalated to medium. This is useful evidence: the easy preset will not ship. Medium enlarges the regular split graph and decoder while keeping the answer at 13 labels and the compact route below the 300-operation cap.
diff --git a/gen_1605_00442.py b/gen_1605_00442.py
